<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Enron Liquids upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Enron Liquids upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it added Enron Liquids Pipeline L.P. to the recommended list, up from the previous market outperformer rating.</p>
<p>-- Set a near-term price objective of $35 a share.</p>
<p>-- Raised the 1997 earnings estimate to $2.25 per unit from $1.60 per unit.</p>
<p>-- Enron Liquids gained 4-1/8 to 33 in afternoon trading.</p>
<p>-- Wednesday, Enron Corp agreed to to sell Enron Liquids to KC Liquids Holding.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
